    "body": "ZORR MODE / FOSS ONLY.\n\nSupersedes draft PR #208 only because the connected GitHub ready-for-review mutation failed at the API schema boundary. Same exact candidate branch/HEAD; no code rewrite.\n\nMINIMAL FORTRESS R01 for DUNCAN PRIME Night School.\n\nScope:\n- fail-closed machine gate for `DUNCAN_NIGHT_REPORT_R01`;\n- exact skill-state allowlist: `UNTESTED / FAILED / PARTIAL / PROVEN`;\n- invalid states such as historical `PARTIAL+` remain archived facts but are not training-eligible;\n- deterministic rebuildable `derived/duncan-night-v1/DUNCAN_CONTEXT_NEXT.json` with RAW SHA-256 provenance;\n- archive verifier detects derived-context tampering;\n- integration into the existing Permanent Archive V1 only;\n- FOSS supply-chain CI: actionlint v1.7.12 MIT, zizmor v1.29.0 MIT, Gitleaks v8.30.1 MIT, upstream-source/release verified and SHA-256 pinned;\n- immutable SHA pins for touched GitHub Actions.\n\nTDD RED/GREEN evidence is preserved in #208 branch history and Actions runs.\n\nNo production/canon/model-weight mutation. PRIME_CORE remains immutable. No proprietary memory/security/agent framework and no second archive/service/database. Administrative ruleset hardening remains a separate platform-admin boundary.",
